WEBVTT

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.390
Princess!

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:28.670
Oshutoru, General of the Right...

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.780
Die, so that Yamato shall live.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:33.780
Oshutoru!

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.590
Leave me be.

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:38.280
Master Haku, you must leave.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:45.070
It's the end for him.

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:47.010
Oshutoru has escaped!

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:49.790
Fugitives sighted!

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.170
Leave this merry bunch to me, 'kay?

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.020
Got our backs to the wall, eh?

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:18.860
After them, men!

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:25.830
Yakutowaruto!

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:40.590
Let me show you the greatest technique you'll ever see in your sorry lives!

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:08.010
Kuon!

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:10.540
Haku!

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:57.430
Unfortunately, it appears Oshutoru escaped,

00:03:57.430 --> 00:04:00.280
and we failed to retrieve the princess.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.030
That damned coward Oshutoru!

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:08.160
We must take action, lest he will undoubtedly bare his fangs at Yamato someday.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:09.660
To that end—

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:11.790
I'll catch him myself!

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:15.670
What is there to discuss?

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:18.670
Dead or alive—it no longer matters.

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:20.960
Notify our soldiers.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:25.800
Moving on then...

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.030
Regarding the princess's recovery...

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.900
They're already right where I want them.

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.200
I've been waiting, my lord.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.070
With me, my men!

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:37.470
They're absolutely relentless!

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.070
What do we do?

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:41.210
Don't ask me!

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:43.440
I will stop them.

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:44.610
You escape.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.210
What are you saying?

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:49.220
<i>You're</i> the one they're after!

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:52.190
We're going after Oshutoru, too.

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:57.280
Wait. The enemy's after Oshutoru.

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:58.730
Haku-san?

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:03.070
The enemy's going to keep sending 
troops after Oshutoru, right?

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:08.740
Which means they're going to have to 
pull troops away from somewhere.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:10.490
I see.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:13.640
We draw the attention of as many 
as we can, and then, poof!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:14.960
We vanish.

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:18.490
So you will use me as a decoy?

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.880
You can't do that!

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:23.600
No.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:30.010
We must consider that as long as they are after me, the princess is safe.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:33.570
But I mean, this plan isn't exactly foolproof.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:34.460
The great gate.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.510
The defenses at the great gate will be weakened.

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:50.010
So what is your plan?

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.030
I'm thinking about it.

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:05.970
She's still feverish.

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.350
I hope this helps.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:15.640
What do we do now?

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:17.560
Let me see...

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.310
Excuse me.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.030
We'll head for the nearest gate.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.500
Don't worry.

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.070
I'm a noble thief.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.320
I'll leave it to you, then.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:39.580
I don't want them to commit any more crimes.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.080
That's all.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:45.970
Y'know...

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.590
About the others...

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.850
{I wanna lend a hand somehow.}I wanna do something about it.{lit. "I want to do something about it", I think they tried to make things ambiguous here so they can do the betraying then help thing later. Didn't do a good job hiding that in Japanese either so it's probably ok leaving it like this}{not enough things to nitpick}{Yeah I get what you're saying, good catch}

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:56.090
I was thinking the same thing.

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:58.000
That's my Ruru-yan!

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:00.100
Great minds think alike and all that!

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:02.610
Come on, let's hustle!

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:03.850
R-Right!

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.280
They're our friends, after all!

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:19.250
Over there!

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.870
As you command, Dekoponpo-sama!

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:23.370
Over there!

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:01.790
But I really don't want to catch them...

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:05.290
I want to go with Haku-sama and Kuon-sama!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:09.720
But...

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:11.710
I...

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:14.960
I...

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:25.220
Time to kick some butt!

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:51.460
Raikou-sama.{"let me just randomly place chess pieces on a map even though I obviously don't have access to real-time information on the chase just so I can look cool and stuff"}

00:09:58.270 --> 00:09:59.900
If we can get through here...

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.970
Why are they trying to kill Anju?

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:26.980
I don't know!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:31.120
But I'd sooner die than let them harm the princess!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:38.780
Kuon!

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:55.050
Kokopo! Help me!

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:06.200
We'll investigate immediately, Dekoponpo-sama!

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:10.430
I know I told you to be a decoy...

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.930
But <i>maybe</i> you could tone it down next time!

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:14.190
No.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:18.440
So long the princess is safe, I care not.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:22.770
I shall engage the enemy.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:23.780
What? Wai—

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:40.160
Not bad.

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:42.900
I've had a lot of practice.

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:53.980
Now!

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.480
Wiped out?

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:00.730
Their safety is unconfirmed?

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.880
Their safety is unconfirmed, huh?

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:07.990
Perfect.

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:14.270
What is it?

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:18.710
I was just thinking that 
mansion's in terrible taste.

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:27.350
I came here all the time to 
clean the gutters, but...

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:29.900
This is Dekoponpo's mansion.

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:32.430
Him, huh?

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:34.770
For some reason, I'm annoyed now.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.540
It would be faster if we could cut through it.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.750
Nothing wrong with a little arson here and there, right?

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.220
Arson, you say?

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.560
I do believe this is the first time we've agreed.

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:53.860
Stop being stupid!

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:58.620
You girls, too!

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:10.350
We have almost arrived, my lord.

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:12.220
Oshutoru is just up ahead.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:13.780
I'm tired of this!

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:14.890
We're going home!

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.950
What!? D-Dekoponpo-sama!

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:22.760
The question is how to disappear, right?

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:24.400
Indeed.

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:27.400
Here's an idea.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:32.410
These sewers run all through the capital...

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.470
Mikazuchi-sama?

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:52.140
Onward!

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.130
Kuon-sama!

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:03.330
Rurutie...

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:10.260
Please...

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:12.070
Don't...

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:15.970
Don't commit any more crimes!

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:23.380
S-So please...

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.710
J-Just let me...

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:39.220
"Don't do something I don't believe in"?

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:42.110
K-Kokopo...

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:46.760
I... I really...

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.230
I really...

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:52.560
Rurutie...

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:54.740
There they are!

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:56.410
Catch them!

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:04.750
What is that!?

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.130
Kokopo!

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.210
Ladies...

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:24.480
You kept me waitin'.

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:27.480
A-Atui-sama!

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:47.500
You're late, c'mon!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:50.500
I went and did everythin' all by my lonesome.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.970
Th-That's not fair!

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:57.260
Huh? What are you on about?

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:00.120
Uh oh! More incoming!

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:00.980
Get on!

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:06.400
What's wrong?

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.300
D-Don't worry about me!

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:12.020
A good woman doesn't hesitate 
to get on a mere boat!

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:17.560
It really does stink.

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:18.780
We'll plug them up.

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:23.390
We'll protect you from the stench.

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:29.880
That'll kill me!

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:34.800
By the way, Haku-san, 
do you know where you're going?

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.510
Don't worry.

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:42.140
Nobody in the capital's cleaned 
as many gutters as me.

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:45.060
Your useless knowledge 
came in handy for once.

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:47.200
I guess so.

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:49.060
Let's take a little break here.

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:53.570
Rest? Should we not be making haste?

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:57.300
Your leg's hurt, right?

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:01.720
He's been trying to hide it this whole time.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:15.290
I'm sorry I didn't notice.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:20.130
Your courage and kindness 
give me strength, Nekone.

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:26.140
Come on, we can't take too long.

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.050
Anju...

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.930
We're in the clear now.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:09.430
V-Vurai's men?

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:12.190
Haku-san!

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:15.690
I was stupid to trust you!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.600
This is bad!

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:25.240
Pops...

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:29.330
Get down, ladies.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:31.330
Atui...

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:33.880
A-Atui-sama...

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:58.670
Damn it!

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:20.400
Haku...
